## Usage

Add the Si7021 library to your project and follow this simple example:

```cpp
#include "Si7021.h"

Si7021 si7021;
float temperature, humidity;

void setup() {
    if (si7021.begin()) {
        Serial.println("Sensor initialized successfully");
    }
}

void loop() {
